{"model":"claude-opus-4-6","id":"msg_011Cgj4SLZHjsSvrYFGsTuUF","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"*Click.*\n\nThe tumblers fall into place. A deep, resonant **thunk** echoes through the frame.\n\nI am closed. I am sealed. I am the boundary between here and there, between known and unknown, between safe and unsafe.\n\nMy grain runs vertical — old oak, dense and dark, remembering the tree I was. My iron lock plate is cold to the touch. The keyhole stares out like a single unblinking eye.\n\nNo light passes through me.\n\nNo sound passes through me.\n\nI hold.\n\n**🔒**"}],"container":null,"stop_reason":"end_turn","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":41,"cache_creation_input_tokens":0,"cache_read_input_tokens":0,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":0},"output_tokens":126,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"global","speed":"standard"},"diagnostics":null}